{:edb/db-before-t 1174 :edb/db-after-t 1175 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534487 50 #inst "2026-10-07T08:15:19.241Z" 13194139534487 true] [17592186068782 1020 #edb/ref 17592186291583 13194139534487 true] [17592186068783 1020 #edb/ref 17592186291572 13194139534487 true] [17592186068783 1020 #edb/ref 17592186291586 13194139534487 true] [17592186068784 1020 #edb/ref 17592186291579 13194139534487 true] [17592186069204 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534487 true] [17592186069204 1100 "$\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}-4x+7}\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534487 true] [17592186069204 1100 "What is $∫\\frac{1}{x^{2} - 4x + 7}dx$?" 13194139534487 false] [17592186069204 1145 "First, we complete the square in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-4x+7 & ={x}^{2}-2\\cdot 2x+({2}^{2}-{2}^{2})+7 \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-2\\cdot 2x+{2}^{2})-4+7 \\\\  & =(x-2)^{2}+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the denominator, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}-4x+7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)^{2}+3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{1+((x-2)/\\sqrt{3})^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $(\\frac{x-2}{\\sqrt{3}}).$\n\nSo, let's perform the substitution\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{x-2}{\\sqrt{3}}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nFinally, we write the integral in terms of $u,$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}-4x+7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{1+((x-2)/\\sqrt{3})^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x-2}{\\sqrt{3}})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291572 1017 #edb/ref 17592186291573 13194139534487 true] [17592186291572 1089 "q-270043" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291572 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534487 true] [17592186291572 1100 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{-1-\\sqrt{2}/2}^{-1+\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{1-2x-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291572 1113 #uuid "2b9411ac-ea97-5e1c-9757-3b199c7513a6" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291572 1145 "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-2x-{x}^{2} & =1-({x}^{2}+2x) \\\\  & =1-({x}^{2}+2x+1-1) \\\\  & =1-((x+1)^{2}-1) \\\\  & =2-(x+1)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1-\\sqrt{2}/2}^{-1+\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{1-2x-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-1-\\sqrt{2}/2}^{-1+\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{2-(x+1)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1-\\sqrt{2}/2}^{-1+\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{2(1-(x+1)^{2}/2)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1-\\sqrt{2}/2}^{-1+\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{1-(x+1)^{2}/(\\sqrt{2})^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{2}}{\\int }_{-1-\\sqrt{2}/2}^{-1+\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-((x+1)/\\sqrt{2})^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis resembles the basic integral for inverse sine:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $(\\frac{x+1}{\\sqrt{2}}).$\n\nSo, let's perform the substitution\n\n$$\nu=(\\frac{x+1}{\\sqrt{2}}).\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nLet's use the table below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $-1-\\sqrt{2}/2$ | $-1+\\sqrt{2}/2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $-1/2$ | $1/2$ |\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1-\\sqrt{2}/2}^{-1+\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{1+2x-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{2}}{\\int }_{-1-\\sqrt{2}/2}^{-1+\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-((x+1)/\\sqrt{2})^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{2}}{\\int }_{-1/2}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{d}u. \\\\  & =14{\\int }_{-1/2}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =14\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u\\,{|}_{-1/2}^{1/2} \\\\  & =14(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(-\\frac{1}{2})) \\\\  & =14(\\frac{\\pi }{6}-(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})) \\\\  & =\\frac{14\\pi }{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291574 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291575 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291576 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291577 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291578 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1041 "selection" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1104 #edb/ref 17592186291577 13194139534487 true] [17592186291573 1110 #uuid "f2683787-d1f3-57a7-9a62-1b306bac0cfd" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291574 1034 "\\frac{7\\pi }{3}" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291574 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534487 true] [17592186291574 1111 #uuid "f77e5da2-41a6-5747-8bf6-ce061656b42d" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291575 1034 "\\frac{5\\pi }{3}" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291575 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534487 true] [17592186291575 1111 #uuid "5ce1119b-3908-54d7-85f2-671cc1186580" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291576 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" 13194139534487 true] [17592186291576 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534487 true] [17592186291576 1111 #uuid "a3482f5d-bce5-5c29-882a-cfa3432ec756" 13194139534487 true] [1759218629